Track pycolmap >= 3.10 API drift.

Upstream pin: Hierarchical-Localization @ v1.4 (80ccb7ee3bc048cb3a8ef221c5bc4d8ac25d5792)

The pinned hloc tag predates pycolmap 3.10, which renamed and re-typed three call sites:
import_images took image_list -> image_names and now requires an ImageReaderOptions instance;
verify_matches moved its RANSAC keyword arguments into TwoViewGeometryOptions; incremental_mapping
requires an IncrementalPipelineOptions. All three also require str paths rather than Path.

Without it: calibration raises TypeError on the first reconstruction call.
